  - i: 1765205441953
    n: Main site
    d: "This is the site with the calculator. First let's create a dummy test here!\nUser can input the value of A and B.\nAfter clicking the calculate button, access to the calculator is revoked, now they can only see the results page.\n\nOn the results page the results are listed. For now it is only the value of C which is A+B.\n\nWhile on the calculator page, we save the input values every 2 seconds to the database, so after an accidental quitting the user can open the website again and continue their work.\n\nAccess is granted from any device, even phones (make it phone friendly) but after we clicked the calculate button, the user has no longer access to the calculator, only the results.\n"
    in[1]: access
    out[1]: input values
    img[0]:
